%% HTTP prefix: /api/v1. API lane includes verified middleware and errorHandler.
%% Grouped read and validation calls short-circuit on error. No Repository layer is implied.
%% Never creates AttendancePenalty or cancels member seats automatically.
sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Center Manager
    participant UI as API client
    participant API as Express middleware / errorHandler
    participant C as attendance.controller.ts
    participant S as attendanceService
    participant DB as Prisma / PostgreSQL

    A->>UI: Request updated attendance warning analysis
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/attendance/warnings/scan
    activate API
    API->>API: authenticate, checkFacilityScope, authorize(MANAGER)
    alt request guard rejects
        API-->>UI: 400 / 401 / 403 error
    else request accepted
        API->>C: scanWarnings(req, res, next)
        activate C
        C->>S: scanAttendanceWarnings(classId)
        activate S
        S->>DB: Compute finalized attendance buckets and read prior warning markers
        activate DB
        DB-->>S: Requested records and validation context
        deactivate DB
        S->>S: Use fixed-course absence allowance or rolling recurring-class attendance policy
        alt scope rejection or computation / persistence failure
            S-->>C: 403 or persistence error
        else business conditions satisfied
            S->>DB: Persist deduplicated advisory warning notifications where thresholds require
            activate DB
            DB-->>S: Saved result
            deactivate DB
            S-->>C: Warning scan summary
        end
        deactivate S
        C-->>API: response or next(error)
        deactivate C
        API-->>UI: 200 result or mapped error
    end
    deactivate API
    UI-->>A: Show result or actionable error
%% UI_SCOPE: Backend/API implemented. Current application UI route is not verified as reachable.
